00:35:18.489 --> 00:35:23.489
He's a patriot to the country, not just the cause.

00:35:23.489 --> 00:35:26.489
That's our Boy Scout.

00:35:26.489 --> 00:35:31.280
All right, wave runners, next time you're in town, be sure to swim by.

00:35:31.280 --> 00:35:33.280
Hi, aye, Captain.

00:35:33.280 --> 00:35:39.599
You'd be seen ya.

00:35:39.599 --> 00:35:52.920
Thanks.

00:35:52.920 --> 00:35:56.920
In case I forgot to mention it, I'm really glad I only booked a one way to Miami.

00:35:56.920 --> 00:35:58.920
Your arms were a lot better than some seat and coach.

00:35:58.920 --> 00:36:00.920
seat and coach.

00:36:00.920 --> 00:36:03.920
You shouldn't have had to fly all the way to Florida just to find me.

00:36:03.920 --> 00:36:05.920
Don't sweat it?

00:36:05.920 --> 00:36:08.920
Those mileage points needed to be used up anyway.

00:36:08.920 --> 00:36:10.920
Lois, you were right to be upset.

00:36:10.920 --> 00:36:13.920
I've been running around acting like it's just me.

00:36:13.920 --> 00:36:18.539
Instead of us.

00:36:18.539 --> 00:36:20.539
The truth is I rely on you more than anyone else.

00:36:20.539 --> 00:36:24.539
I trust you to know parts of me that I don't even trust myself.

00:36:24.539 --> 00:36:29.780
That's why you're the only person I told about the darkness

00:36:29.780 --> 00:36:34.219
that I've tried to fight and failed.

00:36:34.219 --> 00:36:35.219
I know.

00:36:36.219 --> 00:36:39.619
It's just when you look at AC and Mira, how they work together,

00:36:39.719 --> 00:36:45.880
how alike they are, it kind of makes you wonder if we'll ever be like that.

00:36:47.760 --> 00:36:49.059
I mean, you've got to admit, I'm...

00:36:49.059 --> 00:36:53.619
Everything that I'm not, lost, that's why it works.

00:36:54.559 --> 00:36:57.460
Yeah, but two pieces may fit together, but if they're not from the same puzzle,

00:36:57.559 --> 00:36:59.079
it might end up looking like a Picasso.

00:36:59.380 --> 00:37:00.159
But does that matter?

00:37:03.010 --> 00:37:03.510
Depends.

00:37:05.639 --> 00:37:07.420
When you went off to go and save the world,

00:37:09.880 --> 00:37:14.420
I remember what my mom looked like every time my dad left undiplore.

00:37:14.440 --> 00:37:23.940
And it was the hardest thing she ever had to do, but she, she remained stoic until that door closed.

00:37:23.940 --> 00:37:29.989
Because she knew that was how she helped my dad do what he had to do.

00:37:29.989 --> 00:37:34.070
Because they were in it together.

00:37:34.070 --> 00:37:36.070
No matter what.

00:37:36.070 --> 00:37:39.989
And so am I.

00:37:39.989 --> 00:37:45.820
Not the only one.

00:37:45.820 --> 00:37:50.389
You didn't tell anyone about the darkness.

00:37:50.389 --> 00:37:58.699
Because you think you're supposed to be invincible, right?

00:37:58.699 --> 00:38:00.699
Right?

00:38:00.699 --> 00:38:07.789
And it terrifies you that you're not.

00:38:07.789 --> 00:38:09.789
Lois, how am I supposed to protect people?

00:38:09.789 --> 00:38:12.789
Protect you if I can't even protect myself from the darkness?

00:38:12.789 --> 00:38:17.579
By not trying to do it alone.

00:38:17.579 --> 00:38:20.920
We're in this together now.

00:38:20.920 --> 00:38:22.920
All of us.

00:38:22.920 --> 00:38:28.000
And the team needs to know the bigger war we're fighting.

00:38:28.000 --> 00:38:41.550
Welcome to Watchtower.

00:38:41.550 --> 00:38:44.550
The official headquarters of the home team.

00:38:44.550 --> 00:38:47.550
But you are clearly on now.

00:38:47.550 --> 00:38:49.900
Finally.

00:38:49.900 --> 00:38:58.260
Is that a Comset hookup?

00:38:58.260 --> 00:39:01.260
I take back that whole workwife thing.

00:39:01.260 --> 00:39:03.260
Your satellite officially trumps my cell phone.

00:39:03.260 --> 00:39:04.260
Forget it.

00:39:04.260 --> 00:39:08.260
From now on, me comes at us, Sue Comset.

00:39:08.260 --> 00:39:10.260
Thanks.

00:39:10.260 --> 00:39:12.260
Clark, I got your message. Lois.

00:39:12.260 --> 00:39:14.769
Hey.

00:39:14.769 --> 00:39:16.769
What's going on?

00:39:16.769 --> 00:39:19.849
Um...

00:39:19.849 --> 00:39:21.849
We all know what the government was up to.

00:39:21.849 --> 00:39:25.849
But those prisons were part of a much bigger threat.

00:39:25.849 --> 00:39:27.849
Hate crimes are up.

00:39:27.849 --> 00:39:29.849
People like Slade, they're getting more control.

00:39:29.849 --> 00:39:32.849
control and Godfrey's anti-vigilante message,

00:39:32.849 --> 00:39:34.849
it's reaching more ears than ever before,

00:39:34.849 --> 00:39:36.849
and I don't think it's a coincidence.

00:39:36.849 --> 00:39:39.849
Sadly, Clark, there's no mystery to human fear and hatred.

00:39:39.849 --> 00:39:42.849
This time there might be.

00:39:42.849 --> 00:39:45.849
I think there's something more behind the darkness,

00:39:45.849 --> 00:39:49.849
something that hero-haters like Slade don't even know is affecting them.

00:39:49.849 --> 00:39:52.849
When I sent the Kandorans away through the portal in space,

00:39:52.849 --> 00:39:55.849
I opened a door for something else to come to Earth.

00:39:55.849 --> 00:39:59.849
Are you seriously trying to tell me that out of all the intergalactic bad boys,

00:39:59.849 --> 00:40:01.849
we've ever faced, this one's actually worse?

00:40:01.849 --> 00:40:03.849
This is much worse.

00:40:03.849 --> 00:40:05.849
We can't even see it to fight it.

00:40:05.849 --> 00:40:08.849
This thing is like an evil that's spreading over the earth.

00:40:08.849 --> 00:40:11.849
It prays upon the dark side that we already have.

00:40:11.849 --> 00:40:15.849
It feeds on our doubts, our fears, and our distrust.

00:40:15.849 --> 00:40:19.849
Well, I'd say from where I'm standing, it's already on the winning side.

00:40:19.849 --> 00:40:23.380
I think it even affected Slade.

00:40:23.380 --> 00:40:28.789
Just before the facility exploded, I saw something on Slate's skull.

00:40:28.789 --> 00:40:30.789
The Omega symbol.

00:40:30.789 --> 00:40:32.789
It was like it was branded there.

00:40:32.789 --> 00:40:34.789
Almost like the mark...

00:40:34.789 --> 00:40:36.789
Of the beast and revelations.

00:40:36.789 --> 00:40:39.789
Which would explain why he veered so far off his marching orders.

00:40:39.789 --> 00:40:43.789
I'm guessing you don't think that Slade's the only pledge to the Alpha Omega die fraternity, right?

00:40:43.789 --> 00:40:46.789
I think the Omega is a sign of corruption.

00:40:46.789 --> 00:40:49.789
A mark that the darkness is fully taken over someone.

00:40:49.789 --> 00:40:53.789
Didn't Kara say that a person had to be open to the darkness?

00:40:53.789 --> 00:40:56.789
That it can't infect anyone of pure heart?

00:40:56.789 --> 00:40:58.789
And which one of us doesn't have that weakness?

00:40:58.789 --> 00:41:01.789
A hidden hatred or fear that this thing couldn't prey upon?

00:41:01.789 --> 00:41:05.789
couldn't pray upon? So basically this thing doesn't have to do anything.

00:41:05.789 --> 00:41:09.789
It just waits for everybody's weaknesses, and then we destroy ourselves.

00:41:09.789 --> 00:41:15.789
If we can't stop it, the darkness will affect every person on this planet.

